Module(
  body=[
    Expr(
      value=Constant(value='\nUnified Multi-Agent Coordination Module (v10_9) — META Layer Only (RESTORED + ENHANCED)\n\nThis module defines the ENTIRE meta-level multi-agent behavior for the\nv10_9 agentic workflow.\n\nIt is strictly **META-ONLY** (Layer above L1–L5):\n\n    ❌ NO L1 cognition\n    ❌ NO L2 execution\n    ❌ NO L3 orchestration / DAG control flow\n    ❌ NO L4 state mutation\n    ❌ NO L5 safety/policy decisions\n\n    ✔️ Provides multi-agent committees (QA council, Safety observers, etc.)\n    ✔️ Normalizes agent roles and graph topologies\n    ✔️ Performs deterministic scoring + voting\n    ✔️ Generates multi-agent surfaces for self-correction\n    ✔️ Produces patch-ready payloads for L4.StateAdapter (but does not mutate)\n    ✔️ Aligns with the new meta_profile layer (typed biases)\n    ✔️ Maximizes 14/14 agentic architecture compliance\n\nThis unifies meta-coordination behavior lost in 10_9 and restores 10_8\nmulti-agent functionality (committee arbitration, QA/Safety mixed panels,\ndelegation metadata, self-correction surfaces).\n')),
    ImportFrom(
      module='__future__',
      names=[
        alias(name='annotations')],
      level=0),
    ImportFrom(
      module='dataclasses',
      names=[
        alias(name='dataclass'),
        alias(name='field')],
      level=0),
    ImportFrom(
      module='typing',
      names=[
        alias(name='Any'),
        alias(name='Dict'),
        alias(name='List'),
        alias(name='Optional')],
      level=0),
    ImportFrom(
      module='models',
      names=[
        alias(name='MultiAgentVote'),
        alias(name='MultiAgentCouncilResult'),
        alias(name='SelfCorrectionSurface'),
        alias(name='PlanObject'),
        alias(name='StatePatch')],
      level=0),
    ClassDef(
      name='AgentRole',
      body=[
